<FluentCard>
    <FluentStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" VerticalGap="8">
        <H3Label>How this Playbook works</H3Label>
        <PLabel>
            Every Playbook runs three governed stages in order. Use the tabs below to inspect
            each stage's input, processing, and output.
        </PLabel>
        <FluentStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" VerticalGap="2">
            <PLabel>
                <strong>1. Collect:</strong> gathers the raw evidence. See what input was given,
                what action ran, and what data came back.
            </PLabel>
            <PLabel>
                <strong>2. Evaluate:</strong> judges the collected evidence against the rules or
                rubric. See how the evidence was interpreted.
            </PLabel>
            <PLabel>
                <strong>3. Record:</strong> persists the final governed finding. See the result
                that is stored for audit, recall, and replay.
            </PLabel>
        </FluentStack>
    </FluentStack>
</FluentCard>
